/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 49 0 R
/E (On October 2nd, 2026, IIIT Pune came together to magnificently celebrate the enduring legacies of Mahatma Gandhi and Lal Bahadur Shastri. This grand tribute was marked by profound, thought-provoking discussions by 2nd Year Students, Garima Arya and Kavya Srivastava, that allowed students to deeply reflect on Bapu's unwavering commitment to truth and non-violence, as well as Shastriji's remarkable simplicity and resilient leadership.)
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [14]
>>
endobj
72 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 49 0 R
/E (Organised with immense zeal and dedication by the Aarambh club, IIIT Pune witnessed a truly spectacular three-day Ganesh Chaturthi celebration that brought the entire student community together. An aura of pure devotion echoed through the campus, anchored by soul-stirring morning and evening aartis that filled the air with spiritual tranquility and reverence. These sacred rituals were seamlessly followed by vibrant, interactive games and joyous festivities that sparked laughter, teamwork, and strong camaraderie among peers.)
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [15]
>>
endobj
73 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 49 0 R
/E (The campus atmosphere was beautifully transformed by vibrant, intricate rangoli art meticulously crafted by the Rang club, which set a visually striking and patriotic tone for the day. The audience was captivated by soul-stirring, self-composed poetry delivered by the Eclectic club members, eloquently capturing the essence of our nation's history and the sacrifices of its leaders. Adding to the immense cultural richness of the celebration, Shubholaxmi Adhikary \(First Year\) enchanted everyone with a melodious and deeply moving rendition of the patriotic Bengali song 'Utho Go Bharata Lakshmi'. )
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [16]
>>
endobj
74 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 49 0 R
/E (The memorable event was gracefully concluded with an inspiring address by Director Prof. Vineet Kansal. He motivated the student body with the visionary slogan, "Jai Vigyan, Jai Anusandhaan," urging future innovators to build a self-reliant India.)
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [17]
>>
endobj
