76 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 49 0 R
/E (In a beautiful display of unity and tradition, a mesmerizing sea of radiant orange kurtas completely enveloped the institute, painting the campus in pure festive fervour and shared devotion. The grand finale on day three elevated the cultural excitement to entirely new heights. It featured a compelling, thought-provoking street play performed by the Abhinay club and profound, reflective poetry recited by the Eclectic club.)
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [19]
>>
endobj
77 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 49 0 R
/E (After hours of exuberant dancing and unbridled fun, the magnificent celebration culminated in a majestic and deeply emotional Visarjan. Students bid a heartfelt farewell to the deity, leaving everyone with cherished college memories and a lingering sense of divine blessing.)
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [20]
>>
endobj
