/E (In a dedicated effort towards environmental sustainability and collective responsibility, the Indian Institute of Information Technology, Pune organized a Pledge for a Cleaner and Greener Campus, bringing students, faculty, and administration together for a shared cause.)
/Pg 16 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
219 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 55 0 R
/E (The event marked a significant step in reinforcing eco-conscious practices across the institute. The formal pledge ceremony was inaugurated by the Honorable Director of IIIT Pune, Prof. Vineet Kansal, highlighting the institutional commitment to developing a sustainable, clean, and eco-friendly academic environment.)
/Pg 16 0 R
/K [5]
>>
