221 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 55 0 R
/E (On September 25th, 2026, under the Swachhata Hi Seva 2026 campaign, IIIT Pune conducted a campus-wide cleanliness drive with active participation from students, faculty, and staff. The activity covered key campus spaces, including grounds, hostels, and common areas, with a focus on maintaining a clean and hygienic institutional environment.)
/Pg 16 0 R
/K [7]
>>
endobj
222 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 55 0 R
/E (The drive encouraged members of the Institute community to contribute directly to the upkeep of their surroundings and reinforced the importance of responsible waste management, individual accountability, and collective participation. The initiative reflected the spirit of Jan Bhagidari, highlighting that a sustainable and clean campus requires continuous efforts from the entire community.)
/Pg 16 0 R
/K [8]
>>
endobj
223 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 55 0 R
/E (The activity contributed to SDG 3 \(Good Health and Well-being\), SDG 11 \(Sustainable Cities and Communities\), and SDG 15 \(Life on Land\) through its emphasis on hygiene, responsible campus management, and care for the surrounding environment.)
/Pg 16 0 R
/K [9]
>>
endobj
