/E (On September 7th, 2026, IIIT Pune hosted its Internal Hackathon to select student teams for the national Smart India Hackathon \(SIH\) 2026. Ninety-six teams pitched their solutions to 12 faculty evaluation panels, who rigorously judged the projects based on innovation, feasibility, and technical depth.)
