/P 56 0 R
/E (The competing students showcased advanced solutions across critical technological domains, including robotics, agentic AI, cybersecurity, deep learning, and explainable AI \(XAI\). Following this evaluation, the top-performing teams advanced and are now registered on the national SIH portal. Under the guidance of Director Prof. Vineet Kansal, these teams will represent IIIT Pune on the national stage, demonstrating the institute's commitment to solving real-world national challenges.)
